，以进皎","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-fb0d9dcdeb330395f201","label":"正文","text":"皎尝遣兵候，获魏边将吏美女，以进皎","evidence":["zongshi-q-457cce9db9b16c428ffb"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-3b6b451e96c88e2f8c8a","label":"正文","text":"皎更其衣服送还之，下令曰：今所诛者曹氏，其百姓何罪？自今以往不得击其老弱；由是江淮间多归附者","evidence":["zongshi-q-4fb53f9691f394c3dbd4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0054","role":"受进者；送还下令者","evidence":["zongshi-q-457cce9db9b16c428ffb","zongshi-q-4fb53f9691f394c3dbd4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-457cce9db9b16c428ffb","zongshi-q-4fb53f9691f394c3dbd4"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-457cce9db9b16c428ffb","source_order":[51,38,64],"order":9130},{"id":"zongshi-e-o026","title":"皎尝以小故与甘宁忿争，或以谏宁","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-603db16643997e35c307","label":"正文","text":"皎尝以小故与甘宁忿争，或以谏宁","evidence":["zongshi-q-e46dce1fca6feb48c5cb"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-4ca49bfe845b3550ec24","label":"正文","text":"宁曰：臣、子一例，征虏虽公子，何可专行侮人邪！吾值明主，但当输效力命以报所天，诚不能随俗屈曲矣","evidence":["zongshi-q-82bdc632d937118fbace"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-23ff648cff6458afca8e","label":"正文","text":"权闻之，以书让皎：责其与甘兴霸饮因酒发作侵陵其人；教以居敬行简、爱人多容，宜追前愆深自咎责；今烦诸葛子瑜重宣吾意","evidence":["zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-bfc2eb3c9ee917480d8f","label":"正文","text":"皎得书上疏陈谢，遂与宁结厚","evidence":["zongshi-q-4813402efef061b74473"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0054","role":"忿争者；宁语所指之征虏公子（背景）；受书者；陈谢结好者","evidence":["zongshi-q-e46dce1fca6feb48c5cb","zongshi-q-82bdc632d937118fbace","zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15","zongshi-q-4813402efef061b74473"]},{"person":"gan-ning","role":"忿争者；自陈者；书中所护之兴霸（背景）；与之结厚者","evidence":["zongshi-q-e46dce1fca6feb48c5cb","zongshi-q-82bdc632d937118fbace","zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15","zongshi-q-4813402efef061b74473"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"宁所谓明主、所天（背景）；致书责让者","evidence":["zongshi-q-82bdc632d937118fbace","zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0002","role":"受命重宣吾意之子瑜（背景）","evidence":["zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15"]}],"place":null,"time"